<doc id="176845" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176845" title="Olahan Chettinad">
Olahan Chettinad

Masakan Chettinad minangka masakan masarakat sing diarani Nattukotai Chettiars, utawa Nagarathars sing diarani dhewe, saka wilayah Chettinad ing negara &lt;a href="Tamil%20Nadu"&gt;Tamil Nadu&lt;/a&gt; ing India Kidul. Masakan Chettinad bisa uga minangka ongkos sing paling misuwur ing repertoar Tamil Nadu. Nggunakake macem-macem rempah-rempah lan sajian digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Bumbu%20campur"&gt;masala sing digiling&lt;/a&gt; seger. Chettiars uga nggunakake macem-macem daging sing dikeringake srengenge lan sayuran asin, sing nggambarake lingkungan sing garing ing wilayah kasebut. Umume panganan dipangan nganggo iringan adhedhasar beras lan beras kayata &lt;a href="Dosa"&gt;dos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Apem"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puthu%20mayang"&gt;idiyappam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dosa"&gt;adais&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Idli"&gt;idlis&lt;/a&gt;. Wong Chettiars, liwat kontak merkantile karo &lt;a href="Myanmar"&gt;Burma&lt;/a&gt;, sinau nyiyapake jinis puding beras sing digawe sega abang sing lengket. 
Masakan Chettinad nawakake macem-macem masakan vegetarian lan non-vegetarian. Sawetara panganan vegetarian sing populer kalebu &lt;a href="Puthu%20mayang"&gt;idiyappam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paddu"&gt;paniyaram&lt;/a&gt;, vellai paniyaram, karuppatti paniyaram, paal paniyaram, kuzhi paniyaram, kozhakattai, masala paniyaram, adikoozh, kandharappam, seeyam, masala seeyam, kavuni arisi, maavurundai, lan athirasam. Ing panganan Chettinad, rempah-rempah utama sing digunakake kalebu anasipoo (&lt;a href="Kembang%20lawang"&gt;aniseed bintang&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="kalpasi"&gt;kalpasi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Lumut%20kerak"&gt;lichen&lt;/a&gt;), puli (&lt;a href="Asem%20jawa"&gt;asam jawa&lt;/a&gt;), milagai (&lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;lombok&lt;/a&gt;), sombu (&lt;a href="Adas"&gt;biji adas&lt;/a&gt;), pattai (&lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;), lavangam (&lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;cengkeh&lt;/a&gt;), punnai ilai (&lt;a href="Godhong%20teluk"&gt;bay godhong&lt;/a&gt;), karu milagu (&lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;peppercorn&lt;/a&gt;), jeeragam (&lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;wiji cumin&lt;/a&gt;), lan venthayam (&lt;a href="Kelabat"&gt;fenugreek&lt;/a&gt;).
