<doc id="176862" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176862" title="Clabber">
Clabber

Clabber minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa jinis susu sing kecut. Diprodhuksi dening saéngga &lt;a href="Pasteurisasi"&gt;unpasteurized&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nguripake ora nguntungke (ferment) ing tartamtu asor lan &lt;a href="suhu"&gt;suhu&lt;/a&gt;. Suwe-suwe, susu kenthel utawa bisa dadi &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;bahan kaya yoghurt&lt;/a&gt; kanthi rasa asem sing kuat.

