&lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;Bahan&lt;/a&gt; -bahan umum &lt;a href="Susu%20mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;kalebu buttermilk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woh%20Kakao"&gt;cocoa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Beet"&gt;Pewarna beetroot&lt;/a&gt; utawa panganan abang bisa digunakake kanggo warna kasebut
<h2>Variasi</h2>
