Koktail leléwa lawas

Ing gaya lawas iku &lt;a href="Koktail"&gt;cocktail&lt;/a&gt; digawe dening &lt;a href="Uleg-uleg"&gt;muddling&lt;/a&gt; gula karo bitters lan banyu, nambah &lt;a href="Whisky"&gt;wiski&lt;/a&gt; utawa, kurang umum, &lt;a href="Br%C3%A9ndi"&gt;Brandy&lt;/a&gt;, lan garnishing karo irisan orange utawa &lt;a href="Kulit%20jeruk"&gt;zest&lt;/a&gt; lan Cherry cocktail. Biasane disedhiyakake ing gelas gaya lawas (uga dikenal minangka kaca rock), sing ndhisiki koktail.
Dikembangake sajrone abad kaping 19 lan diwenehi jeneng ing taun 1880an, iki minangka &lt;a href="Cocktail%20Resmi%20IBA"&gt;Cocktail Resmi IBA&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga salah siji saka enem omben-omben dhasar sing didhaptar ing &lt;a href="David%20A.%20Embury"&gt;David&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Seni%20Campuran%20Minuman"&gt;Fine Art of Mixing Drinks&lt;/a&gt;.
