<doc id="176876" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176876" title="Permèn jagung">
Permèn jagung

Jagung &lt;a href="Perm%C3%A8n"&gt;permen&lt;/a&gt; minangka jinis permen segitiga cilik, biasane dipérang dadi telung bagean kanthi warna, kanthi tekstur lilin lan rasa adhedhasar &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka permen pokok musim &lt;a href="Mangsa%20gugur"&gt;gugur (musim gugur)&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Halloween"&gt;preinan Halloween&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;. 
Werna tradisional jagung permen yaiku warna kuning, oranye, lan putih nggambarake warna &lt;a href="panen"&gt;panen&lt;/a&gt; musim gugur, utawa &lt;a href="Jagung%20sundhuk"&gt;jagung ing tongkol&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi ujung kuning sing amba meh padha karo &lt;a href="Wiji%20jagung"&gt;jagung jagung&lt;/a&gt;. Alasan liya sing bisa diarani jenenge jenenge permen kaya bentuk sungu unicorn, mula jagung permen (uni).
Sanajan wis ana ing endi-endi, jagung permen duwe reputasi amarga polarisasi, kanthi artikel sing diarani "manis sing paling padu ing Halloween" sing "disenengi" utawa "sebel". 
