<doc id="176918" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176918" title="Roti rye">
Roti rye

Rye roti kalebu jinis &lt;a href="Roti"&gt;roti sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe kanthi macem-macem proporsi &lt;a href="Glepung"&gt;tepung&lt;/a&gt; saka gandum &lt;a href="Gandum%20ireng"&gt;rai.&lt;/a&gt; Werna bisa entheng utawa peteng, gumantung saka jinis tepung sing digunakake lan tambahan agen pewarnaan, lan umume luwih padhet tinimbang roti sing digawe saka &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;tepung&lt;/a&gt; gandum. Serat luwih dhuwur tinimbang roti putih lan warna luwih peteng lan rasane luwih kuat.
Rye Rye dianggep minangka pokok nalika Abad Pertengahan. Akeh macem-macem jinis gandum gandum asalé saka Lor-tengah, kulon, lan negara-negara Éropa wétan kayata &lt;a href="%C3%88slan"&gt;Èslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Finlan"&gt;Finlan&lt;/a&gt;dia, &lt;a href="%C3%89stlan"&gt;Éstlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A8tlan"&gt;Lètlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="B%C3%A8lgi"&gt;Bèlgi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20C%C3%A9ko"&gt;Republik Ceko&lt;/a&gt; lan uga spesialisasi ing kanton &lt;a href="Valais"&gt;Valais&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;. Rye wiji wiji uga umum di Jerman, &lt;a href="Caraway"&gt;winih winih caraway&lt;/a&gt;, sing dikenal ing AS minangka roti rai. Around 500 AD, suku Jerman saka &lt;a href="Wong%20sakon"&gt;Saxon&lt;/a&gt; dienggoni ing &lt;a href="Inggris%20Raya"&gt;Britain&lt;/a&gt; lan ngenalaken Rye, kang uga-cocog kanggo iklim sawijining.
