<doc id="176926" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176926" title="Olahan Israel">
Olahan Israel

Masakan Israel (#ALIH‎
 ha-mitbaḥ ha-yisra'eli) kalebu panganan lan piring lokal sing digawa menyang &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israel&lt;/a&gt; dening wong-wong Yahudi saka Diaspora. Awit saking sadèrèngipun panyiapan saka &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;negara Israel&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1948, lan utamané wiwit taun 1970-an pungkasan, lan Israel &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20campuran"&gt;masakan campuran&lt;/a&gt; wis dikembangaké. 
Masakan Israel wis nggunakake, lan terus adaptasi, kanthi macem-macem gaya &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Yahudi"&gt;masakan Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; diaspora, utamane gaya masak &lt;a href="Olahan%20Mizrahi%20Yahudi"&gt;Mizrahi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olahan%20Yahudi%20Sepharadik"&gt;Sephardic&lt;/a&gt; lan Ashkenazi. Iki kalebu akeh panganan sing kalebu tradisional ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;masakan Timur Tengah&lt;/a&gt; lan Mediterania liyane, saengga rempah-rempah kaya &lt;a href="za%27atar"&gt;za'atar&lt;/a&gt; lan panganan kayata &lt;a href="Falaf%C3%A8l"&gt;falafel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hummus"&gt;hummus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Msabbaha"&gt;msabbha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="shakshouka"&gt;shakshouka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="couscous"&gt;couscous&lt;/a&gt; saiki wis misuwur ing Israel. 
Pengaruh liyane ing masakan yaiku kasedhiya panganan sing umume ing wilayah Mediterania, utamane macem-macem jinis buah lan sayuran, produk susu lan iwak; tradhisi njaga &lt;a href="Kosher"&gt;halal&lt;/a&gt; ; lan &lt;a href="Minhag"&gt;adat istiadat&lt;/a&gt; panganan lan tradhisi sing khusus kanggo &lt;a href="Shabbat"&gt;Shabbat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Challah"&gt;preinan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9inan%20Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi sing&lt;/a&gt; beda, kayata challah, &lt;a href="Jakhnun"&gt;jachnun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="malawach"&gt;malawach&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gefilte%20iwak"&gt;iwak gefilte&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cholent"&gt;hamin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20panggang%20campur%20Yerusalem"&gt;me'orav yerushalmi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sufganiyah"&gt;sufganiyot&lt;/a&gt;.
Piring anyar adhedhasar produk tetanen kayata &lt;a href="jeruk"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Apokat"&gt;alpukat&lt;/a&gt;, produk susu lan iwak, lan liya-liyane adhedhasar tren donya wis dikenal suwene pirang-pirang taun, lan koki sing dilatih ing luar negeri nggawa elemen &lt;a href="Olahan%20campuran"&gt;masakan internasional&lt;/a&gt; liyane. 
