<doc id="176976" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176976" title="Wurstsalat">
Wurstsalat

Wurstsalat (basa Jerman, salad sosis secara harfiah) yaiku &lt;a href="Sosis"&gt;salad sosis&lt;/a&gt; tart sing disiapake nganggo &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt; putih, &lt;a href="Lenga"&gt;minyak&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. Variasi resep nambah &lt;a href="Timun%20acar"&gt;gherkin&lt;/a&gt; jeruk. Biasane digawe saka sosis godhok &lt;a href="Sosis%20bologna"&gt;kaya Lyoner&lt;/a&gt;, stadtwurst, &lt;a href="Regensburger%20Wurst"&gt;Regensburger Wurst&lt;/a&gt; (rong jinis sosis sing wis dimasak) utawa extrawurst. Iki minangka cemilan tradisional ing &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman sisih&lt;/a&gt; kidul, &lt;a href="Alsace"&gt;Alsace&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing Ostenrik diarani Saure Wurst.
Kanggo nyiyapake sajian, sosis dipotong dadi irisan utawa irisan lancip banjur dilebokake, uga nganggo cincin utawa kubus bawang bombay, ing cuka lan minyak &lt;a href="Marinasi"&gt;marinade&lt;/a&gt;, dicampur karo uyah, mrico, lan kadang paprika. Úga tambahan umum sing sacoro apik Cut gherkins, radishes, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;parsley&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Lokio"&gt;chives&lt;/a&gt;. Wurstsalat biasane disajikake karo &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; lan kadhang uga nganggo kentang goreng.
