Panganan panganan cuci mulut kalebu roti sing umure sawetara dina sing diuleni dadi adonan karo &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;mentega&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Prunus%20cerasus"&gt;Ceri asem&lt;/a&gt; utawa ceri manis dilipat ing adonan lan campuran kasebut dipanggang ing sajian kaserol. Sadurunge disuguhake panganan cuci mulut, diwenehi &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;vanili&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="almond"&gt;almond&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;cengkeh&lt;/a&gt; banjur disajekake panas karo saus vanilla.

