<doc id="177013" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177013" title="Troccoli">
Troccoli

Troccoli] &lt;a href="Pasta"&gt;minangka pasta&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="Spag%C3%A8ti"&gt;spaghetti&lt;/a&gt; kenthel sing nuduhake perangan persagi persegi utawa oval. &lt;a href="Basilicata"&gt;Biasane&lt;/a&gt; masakan &lt;a href="Puglia"&gt;Apulian&lt;/a&gt; lan lan asring dibandhingake karo &lt;a href="spaghetti%20alla%20chitarra"&gt;spaghetti alla chitarra&lt;/a&gt; amarga bentuk sing paling utama, sanajan proses kanggo nggawe troccoli biasane ora mbutuhake chitarra sing diarani, sing siji alat khas kanggo nyiyapake spaghetti alla chitarra.Minangka bahan-bahane, troccoli umume digawe karo glepung gandum durum lan banyu, kanthi tambahan opsional kanggo sawetara endhog - mula kadhang kala digandhengake karo tagliolini lan pasta endhog kanthi sakabehe.
