Andong jjimdak

Andong-jrimdak (&lt;a href="Hangul"&gt;Hangul&lt;/a&gt;: 안동찜닭) yaiku salah sawijining olahan arupa macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="Jjim"&gt;jim&lt;/a&gt; (sajian kukus utawa rebus Korea), sing asale saka kutha Andong, Provinsi Gyeongsangbuk-do lan digawe karo pitik, macem-macem sayuran sing &lt;a href="Marinasi"&gt;diasinake&lt;/a&gt; ing saos adhedhasar ganjang (&lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap"&gt;kecap Korea&lt;/a&gt;). Jeneng kasebut tegese "pitik kukus Andong." 
