<doc id="177031" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177031" title="Daging sapi Mongolia">
Daging sapi Mongolia

Daging sapi Mongolia minangka sajian sing disajikake ing restoran Tionghoa sing diiris &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, biasane steak, biasane digawe karo &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. Daging sapi umume dipasangake karo &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;daun bawang&lt;/a&gt; utawa sayuran campuran lan asring ora pedhes. Piring kasebut asring diwenehake liwat &lt;a href="Sega"&gt;nasi kukus&lt;/a&gt;, utawa ing AS, liwat &lt;a href="Mi%20cellophane"&gt;mi mi cellophane sing&lt;/a&gt; renyah.
Daging sapi Mongolia kalebu salah sawijining sajian daging sing dikembangake ing &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Cina"&gt;Taiwan ing&lt;/a&gt; ngendi &lt;a href="Siu%20mei"&gt;restoran barbekyu Cina&lt;/a&gt; pisanan ditemokake. Mula, ora ana bahan utawa cara nyiyapake sing dijupuk saka &lt;a href="Masakan%20Mongolia"&gt;masakan&lt;/a&gt; tradisional Mongolia. 
<h2>Referensi</h2>

