<doc id="177034" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177034" title="Akhni">
Akhni

Akhni (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Banggala"&gt;Banggala&lt;/a&gt;: আখনী) minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa sajian campuran campuran karo asale ing antarane umat Islam Bengali saka Sylhet lan Chittagong, ing &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh sisih&lt;/a&gt; wetan. Iki asring dianggep minangka variasi tartamtu saka &lt;a href="biryani"&gt;biryani&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pilaf"&gt;polao&lt;/a&gt; ; mula istilah akhni birani lan akhni fulao uga umum. Piring kasebut misuwur banget ing restoran ing saindenging &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, uga ing antarane diaspora ing saindenging jagad. Sajrone Ramadhan, &lt;a href="Pananggalan%20Hijriyah"&gt;wulan Islam&lt;/a&gt; pasa, sajian kasebut populer dipangan ing &lt;a href="Iftar"&gt;panganan Iftar&lt;/a&gt; ing seberang Sylhet. Piring kasebut minangka bahan baku ing Chittagong, sing diarani dikonsumsi saben minggu dening rata-rata Chittagonian. 
<h2>Bahan-bahan</h2>
Bahan-bahan.
Iki digawe kanthi nyampur beras karo minyak goreng, rempah-rempah tradisional (&lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="garam%20masala"&gt;garam masala&lt;/a&gt;, tejpata, &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;cumin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Lenga%20samin"&gt;ghee&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wedhus%20domestik"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;), woh-wohan lan sayuran (&lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kapri"&gt;kacang polong&lt;/a&gt;, plum), &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrica cabai&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dahi"&gt;doi sing asem&lt;/a&gt;. Kadhangkala, kacang lan &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; bisa uga ditambahake. 
