Nyamikan halal

Paket cemilan halal minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20cepet%20saji"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; panganan cepet, sing populer ing &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, sing kalebu &lt;a href="Doner%20kebab"&gt;daging kebab sing&lt;/a&gt; disertifikasi kanthi &lt;a href="halal"&gt;halal&lt;/a&gt; (wedhus, pitik, utawa daging sapi) lan &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kripik&lt;/a&gt;. Uga kalebu macem-macem jinis saos, biasane &lt;a href="Saos%20lombok"&gt;lombok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Toum"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Saos%20barbecue"&gt;barbecue&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;Yoghurt&lt;/a&gt;, keju, mrico jalapeño &lt;a href="Tabbouleh"&gt;lan tabbouleh minangka&lt;/a&gt; tambahan umume. Paket cemilan biasane disedhiyakake ing wadhah styrofoam, lan wis diterangake minangka bahan panganan utama toko kebab ing &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. 
Sawetara menu restoran Australia nyebutake sajian kasebut minangka "camilan", "kotak cemilan", "piring campuran", utawa "HSP", tinimbang "paket cemilan halal". Jeneng sajian kasebut dipilih dening Kamus Macquarie minangka "Tembung Pilihan Rakyat taun iki" kanggo taun 2016. 
