Kanthong bumbu

Kantong bumbu (utawa tas pedhes, kothak rempah-rempah utawa kothak pedhes ; #ALIH) minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa panganan cepat saji sing populer ing &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Irlan"&gt;Irlandia sing&lt;/a&gt; diilhami saka masakan Asia. Biasane, tas rempah-rempah kalebu &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;keripik&lt;/a&gt; pedhes goreng, pitik (abon / &lt;a href="Bal%20pitik"&gt;bal&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;swiwi&lt;/a&gt;),  &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;mrica abang lan ijo, mrica&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;cabai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brambang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;bawang goreng&lt;/a&gt;, lan macem-macem rempah-rempah. Kadhang kala diiringi bak &lt;a href="Kari"&gt;saos kari&lt;/a&gt;. Kasedhiya ing takeaway Cina lan gunting wiwit taun 2010-an, sajian kasebut wis ngasilake kultus. Dipilih minangka 'Piring Takeaway Favorit Irlandia' ing Just &lt;a href="Gawa%20mulih"&gt;Take&lt;/a&gt; National Takeaway Awards 2020.
Miturut wartawan RTÉ Liam Geraghty, sajian kasebut kudune digawe ing taun 2010 dening The Sunflower Chinese takeaway ing Templeogue, &lt;a href="Dublin"&gt;Dublin&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi tas rempah-rempah pisanan sing didol ing Just Eat ing taun 2012. &lt;a href="%23endnote_reference_name_A"&gt;a&lt;/a&gt;
