<doc id="177122" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177122" title="Olahan Sami">
Olahan Sami

Masakan Sami minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan masarakat saka wilayah Sápmi kanggo masarakat Sami, sing kalebu ing &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Finlan"&gt;Finlan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Masakan tradisional saben daerah duwe sipat masing-masing.

