<doc id="177123" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177123" title="Salad waldorf">
Salad waldorf

Sunset salad iku &lt;a href="Salad%20woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; lan jangan ing &lt;a href="salad"&gt;salad&lt;/a&gt; umume digawe saka &lt;a href="Panganan%20mentah"&gt;seger&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Apel"&gt;apples&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walnut"&gt;walnuts&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;grapes&lt;/a&gt;, disandangi ing &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt;, lan tradisional dadi ing amben saka Lettuce minangka &lt;a href="Hors%20d%27oeuvre"&gt;appetizer&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Sesuguh"&gt;meal cahya&lt;/a&gt;. Apel, celery, lan anggur kabeh bisa dadi ijo, sing selaras karo palet warna sajian.
Bahan-bahan liyane kayata &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kalkun%20domestik"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Woh%20garing"&gt;woh-wohan garing&lt;/a&gt; (kayata &lt;a href="Kurma"&gt;tanggal&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="kismis"&gt;kismis&lt;/a&gt;) sok ditambahake. Dianyari versi salad kadhangkala ngganti klamben menyang &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;pengalamane&lt;/a&gt; mayonnaise utawa &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;klamben yogurt&lt;/a&gt;. Salad Waldorf modern uga kalebu &lt;a href="Kulit%20jeruk"&gt;rasa&lt;/a&gt; jeruk lan / utawa jeruk nipis. Variasi kalebu &lt;a href="Sel%C3%A9%20kacang"&gt;butter butter&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;basa yogurt&lt;/a&gt;, lan sing ngganti celery karo &lt;a href="kembang%20kol"&gt;kembang kol&lt;/a&gt;.
