<doc id="177143" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177143" title="Bakso landhak">
Bakso landhak

Meatballs Porcupine (&lt;a href="basa%20Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; bakso landhak) iku &lt;a href="Olahan%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;salah sawijining jinis olahan saka Amérika&lt;/a&gt; sajian saka &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20giling"&gt;lemah daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; meatballs masak ing sauce tomat. Iki minangka bahan baku sajrone Depresi Gedhe sing mbutuhake mung sawetara bahan dhasar: daging sapi, &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras gandum dawa&lt;/a&gt;, bawang, lan &lt;a href="Sop%20tomat"&gt;sup tomat&lt;/a&gt; kalengan. Jeneng kasebut asale saka tampilan bakso, sing katon cucuk nalika nasi metu nalika lagi masak, mirip karo &lt;a href="Landhak"&gt;porcupine&lt;/a&gt;. 
Bakso porcupine bisa digawe ing &lt;a href="Pamasak%20alon-alon"&gt;kompor alon&lt;/a&gt; utawa panggang. Dheweke bisa disajikake kanthi &lt;a href="Relish"&gt;nyenengake&lt;/a&gt; kayata kubis abang utawa &lt;a href="Lobak"&gt;kentang lobak&lt;/a&gt; lan mashed. Sisane bisa digawe sandwich.
