Kocok ora udhak

" Shaken, not stirred " minangka tembung rangking agen fiksi &lt;a href="MI6"&gt;Inggris Rahasia Inggris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ian%20Fleming"&gt;Ian Fleming&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="James%20Bond"&gt;, James Bond,&lt;/a&gt; lan nerangake pilihan kanggo &lt;a href="Martini"&gt;nyiapake&lt;/a&gt; koktail martini.,
Frasa kasebut pisanan ditampilake ing novel &lt;a href="Diamonds%20Are%20Forever%20%28novel%29"&gt;Diamonds Are Forever&lt;/a&gt; (1956), sanajan Bond dhewe ora nate nyebutake nganti &lt;a href="Dr.%20Ora%20%28novel%29"&gt;Dr. No&lt;/a&gt; (1958), tembunge persis "goyang lan ora diaduk." Ing adaptasi film novel Fleming, tembung kasebut pisanan diucapake dening wong jahat, Dr. &lt;a href="Julius%20No."&gt;Julius No&lt;/a&gt;, nalika nawakake minuman ing Dr. No (1962), lan ora diucapake dening Bond dhewe (dimainake dening &lt;a href="Sean%20Connery"&gt;Sean Connery&lt;/a&gt;) nganti &lt;a href="Goldfinger%20%28film%29"&gt;Goldfinger&lt;/a&gt; (1964). Iki digunakake ing pirang-pirang film Bond sawise semana lan ora dikatutake &lt;a href="Sampeyan%20Mung%20Urip%20kaping%20pindho%20%28film%29"&gt;You Only Live Twice&lt;/a&gt; (1967), ing minuman kasebut ditawakake kanthi salah minangka "diaduk, ora digoyang", kanggo tanggapan Bond "Perfect", lan &lt;a href="Casino%20Royale%20%28filem%202006%29"&gt;Casino Royale&lt;/a&gt; (2006) ing Bond sing, sawise kelangan mayuta-yuta dolar ing game poker, ditakoni apa dheweke pengin martini digoyang utawa diaduk lan njeblug, "Apa aku katon ora peduli?"

