<doc id="177198" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177198" title="Paklay">
Paklay

Paklay nuduhake rong &lt;a href="Olahan%20Filipina"&gt;Filipino&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nggodhog"&gt;Lion&lt;/a&gt; pasugatan saka &lt;a href="Mindanao"&gt;Mindanao&lt;/a&gt; lan Visayas Kepulauan ditondoi dening julienned úa. Dheweke dipangan karo nasi utawa disajikake minangka pulutan (lauk) kanthi alkohol. 
Ing &lt;a href="Mindanao"&gt;Mindanao&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Eastern%20Visayas"&gt;Visayas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Central%20Visayas"&gt;Tengah&lt;/a&gt; lan Wétan, nuduhake panganan sing digawe saka macem-macem &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Babat"&gt;tripe&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iwak%20wedhus"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt; nganggo &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt; julien &lt;a href="Bung"&gt;, tunas pring&lt;/a&gt; (labong), &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;lada lada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Siling%20mahaba"&gt;siling mahaba cabai&lt;/a&gt; lan tomat, papak, bawang, lan ireng mrico, kalebu bahan liyane. Umumé rada soured karo woh-wohan kaya &lt;a href="nanas"&gt;nanas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asem%20jawa"&gt;lunak&lt;/a&gt;, utawa unripe &lt;a href="Belimbing"&gt;starfruit&lt;/a&gt;. 
Nanging ing antarane masarakat Hiligaynon ing Western Visayas, nuduhake &lt;a href="Bung"&gt;tunas pring sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ngos%C3%A8ng"&gt;diiris&lt;/a&gt; nganggo iwak utawa urang, tomat, daging babi utawa daging sapi, bawang, bawang putih, lan rempah-rempah liyane. 
