<doc id="177228" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177228" title="Zwetschgenkuchen">
Zwetschgenkuchen

Zwetschgenkuchen, Pflaumenkuchen utawa Zwetschgendatschi (kidul &lt;a href="Bayern"&gt;Bavaria&lt;/a&gt;) yaiku kue lembar utawa pie sing digawe saka adonan ragi utawa &lt;a href="Pastry%20kerak%20cekak"&gt;adonan cekak&lt;/a&gt; sing disebar tipis ing lembaran panggang utawa cetakan roti liyane lan ditutup nganggo plum zwetschgen. Iki misuwur minangka kue musim panas lan duwe label lokal sing beda ing saindenging &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing &lt;a href="Hessen"&gt;Hessen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rheinland-Pfalz"&gt;Rhineland-Palatinate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saarland"&gt;Saarland&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Moselle%20%28departemen%29"&gt;Moselle&lt;/a&gt; dikenal kanthi sebutan Quetschekuche, ing &lt;a href="Bayern"&gt;Bavaria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Baden-W%C3%BCrttemberg"&gt;Baden-Württemberg&lt;/a&gt; lan bagean-bagean saka &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt; diarani Zwetschgendatschi lan ing &lt;a href="Rhineland"&gt;Rhineland&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Eifel"&gt;Eifel&lt;/a&gt; Prummetaat. "Datschi" dianggep asale saka tembung dialek "detschen" utawa "datschen" sing bisa diterjemahake minangka "mencubit" (amarga plum dicubit ing adonan). Digawe nganggo pastry shortcrust, &lt;a href="Streusel"&gt;umume disajikake&lt;/a&gt; karo Streusel (campuran mentega, gula lan glepung sing remuk) sanajan resep asline disajikake tanpa topping.

