<doc id="177239" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177239" title="Brik">
Brik

Brik (; بريك) yaiku sajian &lt;a href="Wong%20B%C3%A8rb%C3%A8r"&gt;Berber.&lt;/a&gt; Isine &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;jajanan sing&lt;/a&gt; lancip sak isine lan biasane &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;digoreng&lt;/a&gt;. Versi sing paling misuwur yaiku brik endhog, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;utuh ing kanthong pastry&lt;/a&gt; segi telu kanthi bawang &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bombay&lt;/a&gt;, tuna, &lt;a href="harissa"&gt;harissa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang. Kanthi wangun rada beda, nanging karo úa identik lan cara saka preparation, ing brik Tunisian dikenal ing Aljazair lan Libya minangka bourek بوراك). Brik uga misuwur banget ing &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israel&lt;/a&gt;, amarga akeh masarakat Yahudi Tunisia ing kana. Asring dipenuhi &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; mentah lan &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;jamu&lt;/a&gt; utawa tuna, &lt;a href="harissa"&gt;harissa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;zaitun&lt;/a&gt; lan kadhang disajikake ing &lt;a href="pita"&gt;pita&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga dikenal minangka boreeka. 
Kue brik digawe kanthi nyampur adonan ketan ing permukaan sing ora nemplek ing bunderan sing tumpang tindih kanggo ngasilake ukuran sing dikarepake lan dimasak suwene wektu sing suwe. Lembar adonan &lt;a href="Malsouka"&gt;brik&lt;/a&gt; diarani malsouka utawa warka. Isi khas kalebu &lt;a href="tuna"&gt;tuna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; mentah, &lt;a href="pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20teri"&gt;teri sing&lt;/a&gt; dihiasi &lt;a href="harissa"&gt;harissa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Caper"&gt;capers&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;. 
Apa sampeyan ngerti Brik didhaptar dening CNN minangka salah sawijining masakan endhog paling apik ing donya? 
