<doc id="177263" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177263" title="Volkswagen currywurst">
Volkswagen currywurst

Volkswagen currywurst minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa merek sosis sing diprodhuksi dening pabrikan &lt;a href="Volkswagen"&gt;mobil Volkswagen&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun 1973. Iki diproduksi ing pabrik Wolfsburg perusahaan lan didol ing restoran ing enem pabrik Jerman. &lt;a href="Currywurst"&gt;Currywurst&lt;/a&gt; uga didol eksternal ing supermarket lan stadion bal-balan lan diwenehake marang para pelanggan Volkswagen. Sosis diwenehi tandha minangka "Bagian Asli Volkswagen" lan wis diwenehi bagean nomer 199 398 500 A. Produk kasebut wis diterangake minangka sing paling diprodhuksi saka bagean Volkswagen, udakara 6,81 yuta sosis sing diproduksi ing taun 2018. Ing pirang-pirang taun kepungkur, perusahaan ngasilake sosis luwih akeh tinimbang mobil. &lt;a href="Saos%20tomat"&gt;Ketchup&lt;/a&gt; Volkswagen uga diprodhuksi lan didol kanggo ngiringi kari.

</doc>
<doc id="177265" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177265" title="Sop joumou">
Sop joumou

Sup joumou (; &lt;a href="basa%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: soupe au giraumon) minangka &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; pedhes sing asale saka &lt;a href="Olahan%20Haiti"&gt;masakan Haitian&lt;/a&gt;.
Sayur sup wis tradisional masak karo waluh squash mangsa. Irisan waluh dibungkus ing panci bebarengan karo potongan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ngolah%20gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt; kayata &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, kubis ijo, celery lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. Waluh banjur &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;dikemas murni&lt;/a&gt;, biasane ing &lt;a href="Pemroses%20panganan"&gt;prosesor panganan&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi banyu lan purune bali menyang panci. &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;Garam&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;bumbu uga&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;jamu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; -rempah banjur ditambahake. Sawetara wong Haiti asring nambah &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; lancip kayata &lt;a href="Vermicelli"&gt;bihun&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Markuni"&gt;makaroni&lt;/a&gt; lan sawetara &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;mentega&lt;/a&gt; utawa minyak. A jus jeruk nipis ditambahake sadurunge disajikake. Sup mau mesthi disajikake kanthi panas lan biasane diiringi roti irisan sing dicelupake ing sup. 
<h2>Referensi</h2>

