<doc id="177304" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177304" title="Leberknödel">
Leberknödel

Leberknödel minangka panganan tradisional masakan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, masakan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20C%C3%A9ko"&gt;Ceko.&lt;/a&gt;
Leberknödel biasane kalebu &lt;a href="Ati%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;ati&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan ing wilayah Palatinate &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;Jerman daging babi&lt;/a&gt; digunakake minangka alternatif. Daging digiling lan dicampur karo &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt; lan macem-macem &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt;, asring &lt;a href="pala"&gt;pala&lt;/a&gt; utawa marjoram. Ing Ostenrik, &lt;a href="limpa"&gt;limpa&lt;/a&gt; asring dicampur karo ati kanthi rasio 1/3.
Nggunakake 2 sendok sing wis asor, adonan dibentuk dadi pangsit lan digodhog ing &lt;a href="Duduh"&gt;duduh kaldu&lt;/a&gt; daging sapi utawa digoreng ing daging &lt;a href="Lemak%20babi"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt;.
Amarga konsistensi looser, dumpling sing wis digodhog bisa dipangan seger sawise disiapake, sanajan varian goreng rada kurang rusak amarga kerak sing digawe nggoreng.
Ing Palatinate, Leberknödel asring disedhiyakake karo &lt;a href="Sau%C3%A9rkraut"&gt;sauerkraut&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kenthang%20uleg"&gt;kentang tumbuk&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Bavaria lan Ostenrik biasane disajikake ing sup minangka Leberknödelsuppe (sup dumpling ati).
