<doc id="177341" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177341" title="Pizza puff">
Pizza puff

Puff pizza yaiku &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;kanthong adonan goreng sing&lt;/a&gt; diisi keju, saos tomat, lan &lt;a href="Pizza"&gt;bahan pizza&lt;/a&gt; liyane kayata sosis utawa pepperoni. Pribumi ing &lt;a href="Chicago%2C%20Illinois"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, puff pizza bisa ditemokake ing restoran makan santai ing kana. 
Puffs pizza padha karo &lt;a href="panzerotti"&gt;panzerotti&lt;/a&gt;. Dheweke uga kaya &lt;a href="Calzone"&gt;calzones&lt;/a&gt;, nanging calzones dipanggang tinimbang digoreng, lan ora mesthi kalebu saus pizza. 
Sawetara restoran Italia lan perusahaan makan santai nggawe puff ing pizza dhewe. Puffs pizza iki nduweni bungkus adonan pizza, lan cenderung luwih gedhe tinimbang sing wis digawe. 

