<doc id="177409" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177409" title="Kepithing mrica ireng">
Kepithing mrica ireng

Kepiting mrica ireng minangka salah siji saka loro sing paling populer  cara &lt;a href="Kepithing"&gt;kepiting&lt;/a&gt; disajikake ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Singapura"&gt;masakan Singapura&lt;/a&gt;. Digawe nganggo crabs hard-shell, lan digoreng nganggo &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt;. Beda karo &lt;a href="Yuyu%20pedhes"&gt;sajian kepiting lombok sing&lt;/a&gt; populer liyane, ora masak ing saus lan konsistensi garing. Dadi populer banget kanggo nyampur kepiting mrico karo saus &lt;a href="Nangka"&gt;nangka seger.&lt;/a&gt;Penciptaan kepiting mrica ireng Singapura dipasrahake saka Long Beach Seafood Restaurant ing taun 1959.

