<doc id="177410" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177410" title="Smörgåstårta">
Smörgåstårta

Smörgåstårta (Swedish) minangka sajian &lt;a href="Olahan%20Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;asale saka Swèdhen sing&lt;/a&gt; populer ing &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89stlan"&gt;Éstlan&lt;/a&gt; (diarani võileivatort), &lt;a href="Finlan"&gt;Finlan&lt;/a&gt;dia (diarani voileipäkakku) lan &lt;a href="%C3%88slan"&gt;Èslan&lt;/a&gt; (diarani brauðterta). Kue gurih sing padha karo sandwich, nanging isi lan hiasan sing akeh, padha karo kue krim sing dilapis.
Sawijining smörgåstårta biasane digawe saka pirang-pirang lapisan &lt;a href="Roti%20rye"&gt;roti rai&lt;/a&gt; utawa putih sing ana krime ing antarane. Isi lan topping beda-beda, nanging &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt; asring dadi dhasar; ngisi tambahan bisa beda-beda, nanging asring kalebu salah siji utawa luwih saka ing ngisor iki: &lt;a href="P%C3%A2t%C3%A9"&gt;pate ati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Urang%20%28k%C3%A9wan%29"&gt;urang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, macem-macem &lt;a href="Daging%20mangan%20awan"&gt;potongan adhem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kaviar"&gt;kaviar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="timun"&gt;timun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt;, irisan &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;lemon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;, keju&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Iwak%20Salmon"&gt;salmon&lt;/a&gt; asap.Smörgåstårta disajikake adhem lan dipotong kaya kue panganan penutup. Jinis kue roti isi beda-beda saka daging, iwak, kombinasi keju lan daging, nganti vegan. Dekorasi ndhuwur asring nggambarake bahan sing digunakake kanggo ngisi. Ing Finlan, voileipäkakku [fi] minangka panganan standar ing pakumpulan kulawarga kayata pesta ulang taun, pesta pernikahan, utawa acara panguburan.

