<doc id="177411" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177411" title="Gatsby">
Gatsby

Gatsby &lt;a href="Roti%20lapis%20prau%20silem"&gt;minangka sandwich kapal selam&lt;/a&gt; Afrika Selatan sing kalebu gulung roti sing diisi &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kripik (kentang goreng)&lt;/a&gt; lan pilihan kanggo ngisi lan saos. Asale saka &lt;a href="Cape%20Town"&gt;Cape Town&lt;/a&gt; lan misuwur ing saindenging propinsi Cape Barat. Sandwich biasane gedhe lan cocog kanggo dituduhake dening pirang-pirang wong.
Ora ana resep standar kanggo Gatsby, nanging biasane ditawakake kanthi potongan roti gaya Prancis sing dawa (siji kaki utawa luwih) dawa. Roti liyane sing digunakake bisa uga kalebu roti hotdog utawa &lt;a href="Roti%20India"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; rata. Sandwich digawe gedhe kanggo dibagi, biasane patang cara. Isi Gatsby ngemot chip kanthi macem-macem bahan kayata daging, iwak lan endhog. &lt;a href="Panggang"&gt;Isi&lt;/a&gt; daging bisa uga kalebu &lt;a href="Stik"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt; bakar, steak &lt;a href="Bumbu%20campur"&gt;masala&lt;/a&gt; pitik, &lt;a href="Sosis%20bologna"&gt;sosis poloni, sosis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sosis%20Wina"&gt;Wina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kielbasa"&gt;sosis Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Iwak gorengan utawa acar, &lt;a href="Cumi-cumi%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;cumi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kari"&gt;kari&lt;/a&gt; lan endhog uga asring ditawakake. The fillings umume disandangi karo &lt;a href="Acar%20Asia%20Kidul"&gt;achar&lt;/a&gt; pickles utawa &lt;a href="Peri-peri"&gt;sauce Piri Piri&lt;/a&gt;.  
