<doc id="177414" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177414" title="Salad malfouf">
Salad malfouf

Salad Malfouf utawa Gobis salad (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: سلطة ملفوف‎‎), minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa salad &lt;a href="Olahan%20Arab"&gt;Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, biasane kalebu &lt;a href="Kul"&gt;Gobis&lt;/a&gt; abon, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan mint garing. 
