Tokyo Dome City

Tokyo Dome City (東京ドームシティ, Tōkyō Dōmu Shiti), yaiku kompleks hiburan terpadu ing &lt;a href="Bunky%C5%8D%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Bunkyo, Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Kompleks iki dikenal kanthi jeneng Big Egg City nganti 1 Januari 2000.
Ing kompleks iki, ana stadion bisbol &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Dome"&gt;Tokyo Dome&lt;/a&gt;, (jejuluk "Big Egg"), papan dolanan &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Dome%20City%20Attractions"&gt;Tokyo Dome City Attractions&lt;/a&gt; (biyen Kōrakuen Yūenchi) lan &lt;a href="Korakuen%20Hall"&gt;Korakuen Hall&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing wulan Mei 2003, sawijining resor spa sing dikenal &lt;a href="LaQua"&gt;LaQua&lt;/a&gt; mbukak bisnis ing cedhak Tokyo Dome City Attractions. Iki uga dadi papan acara pertunjukan karakter kanggo &lt;a href="Toei%20Company"&gt;Toei Company&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu seri &lt;a href="Kamen%20Rider"&gt;Kamen Rider&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Super%20Sentai"&gt;Super Sentai&lt;/a&gt; (Tokyo Dome Corporation dadi sponsor utama seri Super Sentai).
Tokyo Dome City ngemot Tokyo Dome Hotel, hotel kanthi lantai 43 sing gampang dideleng saka dalan lan saka Stasiun Subway Suidobashi Tokyo, sing mung adoh saka rong blok.
