<doc id="177548" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177548" title="Olahan Honduras">
Olahan Honduras

Masakan &lt;a href="Honduras"&gt;Honduran&lt;/a&gt; minangka gabungan saka masakan Mesoamerican (Lenca), &lt;a href="Olahan%20Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olahan%20Karibia"&gt;Karibia&lt;/a&gt; lan Afrika. Uga ana pasugatan saka masarakat Garifuna. &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;Klapa&lt;/a&gt; lan santen ditampilake ing sajian sing legi lan gurih. Spesialisasi regional kalebu &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; goreng, &lt;a href="Tamal%C3%A9"&gt;tamale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="carne%20asada"&gt;carne asada&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="baleada"&gt;baleada&lt;/a&gt;. Piring liyane sing misuwur kalebu daging panggang karo chismol lan &lt;a href="carne%20asada"&gt;carne asada&lt;/a&gt;, pitik karo beras lan jagung, lan iwak goreng kanthi bawang bombay lan &lt;a href="Jalap%C3%A9%C3%B1o"&gt;jalapeños&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wilayah pesisir lan Kepulauan Bay, panganan laut lan sawetara daging disiapake kanthi akeh cara, kalebu &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;santan&lt;/a&gt;.
Antarane sup sing disenengi Hondurans yaiku sup kacang, sup mondongo (sup tripe), sup panganan laut lan sup &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi.&lt;/a&gt; Umume kabeh sup iki dicampur karo &lt;a href="Ngolah%20gedhang"&gt;plantain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ket%C3%A9la%20pohung"&gt;yuca&lt;/a&gt;, lan kubis, lan disedhiyakake karo &lt;a href="tortilla"&gt;tortilla&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;.
Panganan khas liyane yaiku montucas utawa jagung, jagung, lan tamale sing dibungkus godhong plantain. Piring khas Honduran uga kalebu pilihan woh-wohan tropis kayata &lt;a href="Kat%C3%A8s"&gt;papaya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="nanas"&gt;nanas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="plum"&gt;plum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sapote"&gt;sapote&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Markisa"&gt;woh-wohan semangat&lt;/a&gt;, lan gedhang sing disiapake kanthi akeh cara nalika isih ijo.
